tab3 columns: wrote 24 of "\t|a\t|abcdefg\t|abcdefgh\t|" gives "        |a      |abcdefg        |abcdefgh       |"
tab3 control doesn't move: wrote 4 of "\x01\x02\t|" gives "\x01\x02        |"
tab3 del doesn't move: wrote 3 of "\x7f\t|" gives "\x7f        |"
tab3 high bytes: wrote 4 of "\xc3\xa9\t|" gives "\xc3\xa9      |"
tab3 backspace at the start: wrote 3 of "\b\t|" gives "\b        |"
tab3 backspace: wrote 7 of "abc\b\b\t|" gives "abc\b\b       |"
tab3 return: wrote 6 of "abc\r\t|" gives "abc\r        |"
tab3 line feed no onlcr: wrote 6 of "abc\n\t|" gives "abc\n     |"
tab3 line feed no onlcr onlret: wrote 6 of "abc\n\t|" gives "abc\n        |"
tab3 line feed: wrote 6 of "abc\n\t|" gives "abc\r\n        |"
onocr after text: wrote 11 of "\rabc\r\rdef\n\r" gives "abc\rdef\r\n"
olcuc high bytes: wrote 4 of "az\xe9{" gives "AZ\xc9{"
column across writes: "abc     |abc       |"
master write: 4
master write: read "a\tb\n" EAGAIN
master echo: 0

== L8 VMIN and VTIME
0,0 empty: 0 "" soon
0,0 empty, non-blocking: 0 "" soon
0,0 empty: poll 1 OUT
0,0: keys "abc" echo ""
